{*NYSS 7852*}
{htxt id="category" override=1}
    <p>Mailing categories allow your constituents to choose which types of mailings they want to (or don't want to) receive. For example, they might choose to unsubscribe from newsletters but continue receiving emergency alerts.</p>
    <p>A mailing category is required for all mailings and defaults to <strong>General Announcements</strong>. Change it when appropriate to properly categorize your mailing and respect your constituents' mail preferences.</p>
{/htxt}

{*NYSS*}
{htxt id="all-emails" override=1}
  <p>By default, Bluebird will send to the contact's primary email address and any additional email addresses explicitly marked for bulk mail.</p>
  <p>Selecting this option will send your email to all addresses present for a given contact, regardless of whether it is a primary email or marked for bulk mail sending.</p>
{/htxt}
